1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 19=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:44,639
Liang Yu, Commander
of the Shence Garrison,

7
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,960
has enjoyed His Majesty's favor,

8
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,399
yet has given no thought
to serving the realm.

9
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,279
He colluded with Dai Rong

10
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,479
and formed a faction for personal gain.

11
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:55,279
He disregarded the greater good

12
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:57,080
and pursued his own interests.

13
00:01:57,599 --> 00:02:01,800
He is hereby stripped
of office and imprisoned,

14
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:04,080
pending further judgment.

15
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,560
- He's coming out!
- He's coming out!

16
00:02:22,319 --> 00:02:23,158
What a disgrace!

17
00:02:23,159 --> 00:02:24,280
Lin Jinqi,

18
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:26,158
I had no grudge against you,

19
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,560
yet you kept coming after me

20
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:28,679
and wouldn't let up.

21
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,079
You old scoundrel!

22
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:32,120
How dare you accuse others
of your own crimes!

23
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:40,639
This pile of horse manure is

24
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:42,100
for our brothers who died unjustly.

25
00:02:42,110 --> 00:02:44,440
You heartless beast!
Even horse manure is cleaner than you!

26
00:02:44,456 --> 00:02:46,950
- Beat him to death!
- Beat him to death!

27
00:02:51,879 --> 00:02:53,399
That's enough!

28
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:55,160
Make way!

29
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,680
Everyone, move aside.

30
00:03:00,728 --> 00:03:03,288
Don't interfere with
Judicial Officer Yang's official duties.

31
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:20,119
Today,

32
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,660
I must return to report on my mission,

33
00:03:21,672 --> 00:03:22,840
so I can't stay long.

34
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,119
Next time,

35
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,639
we'll have a proper gathering.

36
00:03:38,456 --> 00:03:40,720
This time, it was thanks
to Assistant Commander Lin

37
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:43,039
that the truth finally came to light.

38
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,039
Our fallen brothers

39
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:47,000
can finally rest in peace.

40
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,320
I can't take the credit.

41
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:52,120
From capturing the Wo pirates

42
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:53,799
and arresting Dai Rong

43
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:55,280
to exposing Liang Yu,

44
00:03:55,304 --> 00:03:56,552
every one of you played a part.

45
00:03:56,648 --> 00:03:58,070
I've reported everything truthfully.

46
00:03:58,088 --> 00:03:59,850
When the rewards
are given for your service,

47
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:01,250
every one of you will get your due!

48
00:04:01,260 --> 00:04:03,359
- Good!
- Good!

49
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:06,799
- Good!
- Good!

50
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:09,000
- Good!
- Good!

51
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:27,720
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

52
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,560
Tongcao, Baogai.

53
00:04:30,168 --> 00:04:32,120
Luckily, you two brought it
to our attention,

54
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:34,679
allowing Lanxiang
to discover that Du Cuique

55
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:37,240
had ordered Lingdang
to poison the bathwater.

56
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:39,519
This is your reward.

57
00:04:44,712 --> 00:04:47,464
- Thanks for the reward, First Madam.
- Thanks for the reward, First Madam.

58
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:50,519
Gantang.

59
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,638
Your mother has been by my side

60
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:56,199
and served me for several years.

61
00:04:56,519 --> 00:04:59,480
I find you even
more capable than your mother.

62
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,278
Keep up the good work.

63
00:05:01,279 --> 00:05:03,279
The Lin Residence will treat you well.

64
00:05:03,336 --> 00:05:04,950
Thank you for the reward,
First Madam.

65
00:05:15,279 --> 00:05:16,399
Lanxiang.

66
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,638
This time,

67
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:24,959
you practically saved everyone
in the Lin Residence.

68
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,599
That's no small achievement.

69
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:28,120
Besides gold and silver,

70
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,320
is there anything else you want?

71
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,959
You've always been open and forthright.

72
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:44,199
Whatever you want,
don't hesitate to ask.

73
00:05:58,079 --> 00:05:59,119
First Madam.

74
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,438
I humbly ask

75
00:06:00,439 --> 00:06:02,000
that you grant me

76
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:04,480
the indentures of all three members

77
00:06:04,639 --> 00:06:05,920
of my family.

78
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,959
You want to become free commoners?

79
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,800
I beg you to grant
my request, First Madam.

80
00:06:29,256 --> 00:06:31,384
Why do you suddenly want
to buy your family's freedom

81
00:06:31,432 --> 00:06:32,750
and leave?

82
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,679
Was your father

83
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,040
mistreated at the shop,

84
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:38,639
or have you been
treated harshly in the residence?

85
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,599
My father hasn't been mistreated at all,

86
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,719
nor have I been treated
harshly in any way.

87
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,352
Our masters have been generous and kind.

88
00:06:45,384 --> 00:06:47,150
Our whole family is truly fortunate.

89
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,920
It's just that

90
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:52,040
I've been frail since childhood.

91
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,680
To pay for my treatment,

92
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,559
my parents scrimped and saved

93
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,800
and never had a single day of comfort.

94
00:06:57,879 --> 00:06:59,878
Now that they're getting old,

95
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:03,800
I only want to stay
by their side and care for them.

96
00:07:03,992 --> 00:07:05,576
I don't want the day to come

97
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:07,830
when I wish to care for them,
but they're no longer here.

98
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:13,599
Your devotion
to your parents is admirable,

99
00:07:14,319 --> 00:07:16,159
and what you say makes sense.

100
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:21,759
But you currently serve at Zhichun Hall.

101
00:07:21,879 --> 00:07:23,000
As for this,

102
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:26,240
we should still ask
Young Master what he thinks.

103
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:29,470
Thank you for your kindness
and understanding, First Madam,

104
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,680
and for not holding

105
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,399
this personal wish of mine against me.

106
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,719
You heartless girl.

107
00:07:58,759 --> 00:08:00,199
You're ready to leave just like that,

108
00:08:00,279 --> 00:08:02,040
without a thought for us.

109
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,159
Who says I'm leaving just like that?

110
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,920
First Madam hasn't agreed yet.

111
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:09,359
You've done
such a great service this time.

112
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:11,040
First Madam is sure to agree.

113
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:15,398
We shouldn't presume

114
00:08:15,399 --> 00:08:17,480
to know what our masters are thinking,

115
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,360
or we'll only get our hopes up.

116
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:40,319
Ever since we returned to Zhichun Hall,

117
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:42,199
you've been so downhearted.

118
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:45,040
Where did that cheerful,
talkative Xiaolian go?

119
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,040
That's right.

120
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:49,040
Where did the old Xiaolian go?

121
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,839
Aren't you

122
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,800
angry with me?

123
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,680
The first time Lingdang
went to the tea room,

124
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,680
I was the one who showed her there.

125
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:09,040
I must have been completely blind,

126
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,879
mistaking a bad person for a good one.

127
00:09:11,256 --> 00:09:12,630
Who knows how many things I said

128
00:09:12,639 --> 00:09:14,439
that I shouldn't have

129
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:16,560
or how many things I did
that I shouldn't have.

130
00:09:18,759 --> 00:09:20,999
Are you afraid
First Madam will punish you?

131
00:09:23,879 --> 00:09:26,400
If I did something wrong,
I should be punished.

132
00:09:26,919 --> 00:09:28,999
I just feel so foolish.

133
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:29,719
I almost caused...

134
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,119
By that reasoning,

135
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:34,239
Young Master and First Madam
are the most at fault, then.

136
00:09:35,448 --> 00:09:37,310
Young Master brought
Du Zheng and his sister

137
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,719
back from Jinzhou,

138
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:41,032
and First Madam arranged
for them to enter the residence.

139
00:09:41,799 --> 00:09:43,119
That's not the same.

140
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:46,158
Young Master and First Madam
were deceived because of their kindness.

141
00:09:46,159 --> 00:09:47,479
Weren't you the same?

142
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:49,320
Exactly.

143
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:51,278
You were deceived

144
00:09:51,279 --> 00:09:52,999
because you were too kindhearted.

145
00:09:54,399 --> 00:09:55,758
It's all in the past now.

146
00:09:55,759 --> 00:09:58,079
Don't keep blaming yourself.

147
00:09:59,679 --> 00:10:00,440
Then,

148
00:10:01,279 --> 00:10:03,440
by your reasoning,

149
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,440
I did nothing wrong at all?

150
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:12,879
Of course you did something wrong.

151
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,518
Young Master and First Madam

152
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:17,398
trusted Du Zheng and his sister because

153
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:19,839
Du Zheng had once
saved Young Master's life.

154
00:10:19,919 --> 00:10:21,160
But you?

155
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,558
You hardly knew Du Cuique at all,

156
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:25,959
yet you plunged right in
without a second thought.

157
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,558
As the old saying goes,

158
00:10:27,559 --> 00:10:29,079
never seek to harm others,

159
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:31,280
but always guard against harm.

160
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:35,239
You only followed the first half,

161
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:37,512
but neglected the second.

162
00:10:37,672 --> 00:10:38,990
So naturally, one careless step

163
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,520
was enough to make you stumble.

164
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:46,999
Never seek to harm others,

165
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:53,798
but always guard against harm.

166
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:55,560
Then stop feeling bad.

167
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,959
Now that the three of us
have come into some money,

168
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:00,119
you'd better sweet-talk us

169
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:02,119
and keep us three wealthy ladies happy.

170
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:04,280
There'll be plenty in it for you.

171
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:27,079
These are gifts for you.

172
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:28,400
Gifts?

173
00:11:29,510 --> 00:11:31,650
Gantang said before
that she wanted to learn to read,

174
00:11:31,660 --> 00:11:32,918
so I asked Jiugao to buy a beginner's

175
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:35,320
(Three Character Classic)
copy of the Three Character Classic.

176
00:11:35,336 --> 00:11:37,070
The Three Character Classic?

177
00:11:46,279 --> 00:11:47,959
It smells of fresh ink.

178
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,199
What good is giving us books?

179
00:11:55,799 --> 00:11:57,440
You're about to leave the residence.

180
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,879
There'll be no one to teach us.

181
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,119
Can these words

182
00:12:00,399 --> 00:12:02,800
tell us how to read them on their own?

183
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:07,079
I've already spoken to Yuchan.

184
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,558
As long as you're willing to learn,

185
00:12:08,559 --> 00:12:10,479
Yuchan will teach you.

186
00:12:10,759 --> 00:12:11,879
Really?

187
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:16,280
Will Yuchan really agree?

188
00:12:17,039 --> 00:12:18,160
Back then,

189
00:12:18,799 --> 00:12:20,119
I learned to read from the maid

190
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:22,160
who kept the account books
for First Madam.

191
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,638
Now,

192
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:25,680
as long as you're
sincere about learning,

193
00:12:25,799 --> 00:12:27,400
I'll gladly teach you.

194
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,640
I truly want to learn.

195
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,839
- So do I.
- So do I.

196
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:38,239
I'll take you three
on as my students for now.

197
00:12:38,399 --> 00:12:40,999
But how much you learn

198
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,119
will depend on each of you.

199
00:12:49,679 --> 00:12:51,320
You're the one who started all this,

200
00:12:51,559 --> 00:12:54,320
and now you're the one backing out.

201
00:12:56,159 --> 00:12:57,278
First Madam hasn't agreed

202
00:12:57,279 --> 00:12:58,560
to let me leave yet.

203
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:01,239
Young Master went to Rongzhang House.

204
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:03,839
I imagine he's there
to discuss your request.

205
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:05,440
Once Young Master returns,

206
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,999
we'll know the answer.

207
00:13:17,039 --> 00:13:18,800
After Lanxiang
distinguished herself before,

208
00:13:19,039 --> 00:13:20,599
she never asked for a reward.

209
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:23,239
So she was saving up her merits

210
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,719
to ask for her indenture.

211
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:30,439
Lanxiang is clever and capable,

212
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,359
and you're relying
on her heavily right now.

213
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:35,359
I thought you
wouldn't want to let her go.

214
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,959
Lanxiang is capable,

215
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:46,038
but Yuchan and Gantang
are just as capable.

216
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:47,752
It's not as though
we can't do without her.

217
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,400
As for Du Zheng and his sister,

218
00:13:56,639 --> 00:13:58,400
the Lin Residence
has a clear conscience.

219
00:13:58,919 --> 00:14:00,798
But outsiders
don't know the whole story,

220
00:14:00,799 --> 00:14:02,560
so some criticism is inevitable.

221
00:14:03,304 --> 00:14:05,550
By granting Lanxiang
and her family their freedom now,

222
00:14:05,559 --> 00:14:07,320
we can set an example
within the residence

223
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:10,278
and show the servants
that as long as they serve faithfully,

224
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:12,184
their masters
will never treat them unfairly.

225
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:14,839
It will also silence those outside
who seek to make trouble

226
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,079
and show them

227
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,359
that in the Lin Residence,

228
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:19,638
whether master or servant,

229
00:14:19,639 --> 00:14:21,040
we value loyalty and honor.

230
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:24,040
We were thinking the same thing.

231
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,520
Then this matter

232
00:14:25,759 --> 00:14:27,040
is settled.

233
00:14:30,039 --> 00:14:33,359
Give the indentures for Lanxiang
and her parents to Young Master.

234
00:14:46,279 --> 00:14:47,440
I'll take my leave.

235
00:14:57,759 --> 00:14:59,959
Lanxiang is clever and capable.

236
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:03,400
I really am reluctant to let her go.

237
00:15:03,879 --> 00:15:06,640
But Zhichun Hall
really can't keep her either.

238
00:15:07,679 --> 00:15:09,518
What madam of the household

239
00:15:09,519 --> 00:15:11,239
could tolerate having her husband

240
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,959
keep such
an outstanding maid by his side?

241
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:16,918
I originally planned to wait until
the inner residence was put in order

242
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:19,310
and the mess left by Du Zheng
and his sister was dealt with,

243
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,038
then before Young Master's engagement,

244
00:15:21,039 --> 00:15:23,599
find Lanxiang another place to go.

245
00:15:25,039 --> 00:15:26,520
But now,

246
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,160
it seems I worried for nothing.

247
00:15:28,919 --> 00:15:30,680
A girl as clever as she is

248
00:15:30,919 --> 00:15:33,839
would naturally plan her own future.

249
00:15:34,639 --> 00:15:36,920
This is for the best.

250
00:15:37,159 --> 00:15:39,599
It brings our bond as madam
and servant to a fitting end.

251
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:48,479
Young Master is my own son,

252
00:15:48,799 --> 00:15:51,680
yet now even I can't understand him.

253
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,999
How did he agree so readily?

254
00:15:55,879 --> 00:15:59,280
I thought this would
take some persuading.

255
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:05,758
Young Master isn't like Master.

256
00:16:05,759 --> 00:16:07,719
He doesn't mistake
womanizing for refinement.

257
00:16:09,279 --> 00:16:11,520
Zhao Xingtang has done
so many outrageous things,

258
00:16:11,799 --> 00:16:14,320
yet Young Master has never
once suggested taking a concubine.

259
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:17,680
That shows how devoted he is.

260
00:16:18,159 --> 00:16:19,479
Just like you, First Madam.

261
00:16:22,039 --> 00:16:24,959
Amaranth in the seventh month
is worth its weight in gold!

262
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:27,239
(Glorify the Family Name)

263
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,239
Keeping busy?

264
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:35,119
Amaranth!

265
00:16:46,620 --> 00:16:49,380
(Indentures)

266
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:56,599
These are the indentures
for your family.

267
00:17:01,016 --> 00:17:03,640
And this is the deed of emancipation
I've signed and sealed.

268
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:12,100
(Party to the Agreement: Lin Jinqi)

269
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,250
(Deed of Emancipation)

270
00:17:13,260 --> 00:17:14,088
(Party to the Agreement: Lin Jinqi)

271
00:17:14,504 --> 00:17:15,830
Take a look.

272
00:17:16,279 --> 00:17:17,679
If everything is in order,

273
00:17:17,688 --> 00:17:19,590
Jiugao will accompany you
to the authorities

274
00:17:19,590 --> 00:17:21,210
to complete
the emancipation formalities.

275
00:17:21,220 --> 00:17:22,960
With the Lin Residence
acting as guarantor,

276
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,890
you'll be registered
with a nearby neighborhood.

277
00:17:26,280 --> 00:17:28,070
Thank you for your kindness,
Young Master.

278
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:29,318
Quickly, thank him.

279
00:17:29,319 --> 00:17:31,239
- Thank you for your kindness, Young Master.
- Thank you for your kindness, Young Master.

280
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,959
Thank you for your kindness,
Young Master.

281
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:34,648
Thank you for your kindness,
Young Master.

282
00:17:56,119 --> 00:17:58,359
You're no longer servants
of the Lin Residence.

283
00:17:58,799 --> 00:17:59,720
From now on,

284
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,879
you needn't kneel and bow to me anymore.

285
00:18:03,039 --> 00:18:04,119
This...

286
00:18:14,056 --> 00:18:15,550
You're most gracious, Young Master.

287
00:18:15,559 --> 00:18:17,720
Our family can never thank you enough.

288
00:18:17,896 --> 00:18:20,888
- You're most gracious, Young Master.
- You're most gracious, Young Master.

289
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:37,278
This...

290
00:18:37,279 --> 00:18:39,119
First Madam gave you 150 taels,

291
00:18:39,319 --> 00:18:41,200
and Young Master gave you 100 taels.

292
00:18:41,279 --> 00:18:42,919
That's 250 taels of silver in total.

293
00:18:43,519 --> 00:18:46,078
First Madam said it's difficult
to find a home in Jinling City.

294
00:18:46,079 --> 00:18:48,040
She said not to rush
and to take your time.

295
00:18:48,136 --> 00:18:49,400
Until you find a suitable place,

296
00:18:49,448 --> 00:18:51,150
you may continue living where you are.

297
00:18:51,319 --> 00:18:52,798
Once everything is settled,

298
00:18:52,799 --> 00:18:54,480
choose an auspicious day to move.

299
00:18:56,279 --> 00:18:57,639
First Madam also said

300
00:18:57,640 --> 00:19:01,040
your family
should live well from now on.

301
00:19:01,144 --> 00:19:02,470
If you ever run into difficulties,

302
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:03,560
just come to us.

303
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:06,240
You were once part of the Lin household.

304
00:19:06,359 --> 00:19:07,919
No matter where you go in the future,

305
00:19:08,599 --> 00:19:11,399
the bond between us
will remain unchanged.

306
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:13,480
This...

307
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:17,879
This...

308
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:21,199
Thank you, Young Master and
First Madam, for your great kindness.

309
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:21,879
This...

310
00:19:23,039 --> 00:19:25,119
We don't know
how we could ever repay you.

311
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:28,790
First Madam, Young Master,
for all you've done for us,

312
00:19:28,799 --> 00:19:31,199
our whole family will always
remember your kindness.

313
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,919
Every day,
we'll kowtow to the Bodhisattva

314
00:19:33,192 --> 00:19:34,870
and pray
for the Bodhisattva's blessings.

315
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:36,590
May First Madam
be blessed with many descendants

316
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:37,990
and an ever-flourishing family line.

317
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,950
May Young Master
be blessed with a destined match

318
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:41,359
and a marriage made in heaven.

319
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:45,480
Yes.

320
00:19:45,510 --> 00:19:47,864
Every day, we'll kowtow
and burn incense to the Bodhisattva

321
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:48,990
and pray
for the Bodhisattva's blessings.

322
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:49,598
May...

323
00:19:49,599 --> 00:19:51,320
May the Bodhisattva bless you.

324
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:54,439
You certainly have a way with words.

325
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,079
What you said

326
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:58,119
is exactly
what First Madam and I wish for.

327
00:19:58,696 --> 00:20:00,310
May your auspicious words come true.

328
00:20:00,319 --> 00:20:01,560
I hope that someday,

329
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:03,560
everything will turn out
just as we wish.

330
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:11,399
Jiugao, before the government office
closes for the day,

331
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,798
take Uncle Xu and his family there

332
00:20:12,799 --> 00:20:14,140
and get their things done at once.

333
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:14,879
Yes.

334
00:20:15,599 --> 00:20:16,760
Uncle Xu, Aunt Xu.

335
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:17,800
Let's go.

336
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:20,552
- We're leaving, Young Master.
- We're leaving.

337
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:26,820
♪My restless heart
seeks a place to anchor♪

338
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:32,980
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

339
00:20:39,599 --> 00:20:41,159
She certainly looks happy.

340
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:44,078
Not the least bit reluctant to leave.

341
00:20:44,079 --> 00:20:49,299
♪Half a lifetime
of longing returns to this moment♪

342
00:20:49,300 --> 00:20:56,900
♪Love and guilt intertwine,
what if the reflection isn't real?♪

343
00:20:57,460 --> 00:21:03,020
♪I still remember your name♪

344
00:21:04,620 --> 00:21:11,900
♪I no longer blame the moon
for withholding its light♪

345
00:21:12,220 --> 00:21:19,700
♪I only pray that those
I've known still live and thrive♪

346
00:21:19,780 --> 00:21:27,140
♪No longer let the world's wind and snow fall,
leaving the grass and trees covered in frost♪

347
00:21:27,660 --> 00:21:31,259
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

348
00:21:31,260 --> 00:21:36,020
♪You and I will walk there together♪

349
00:21:47,799 --> 00:21:49,919
So it's a bride leaving for her wedding.

350
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:51,720
No wonder the drums
and music are so loud.

351
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,560
Do you know who the bride is?

352
00:22:01,839 --> 00:22:03,760
Grand Secretary Zhao's
eldest granddaughter,

353
00:22:04,559 --> 00:22:05,800
Young Lady Zhao,

354
00:22:06,744 --> 00:22:08,560
is marrying
into a family in the capital.

355
00:22:35,079 --> 00:22:36,879
Father, Mother.

356
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:37,518
Let's go.

357
00:22:37,520 --> 00:22:39,270
Let's get our
household registration papers.

358
00:22:39,280 --> 00:22:40,720
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

359
00:22:46,039 --> 00:22:47,159
Will we make it in time?

360
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:48,239
We will.

361
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,256
Will we make it in time?

362
00:22:49,288 --> 00:22:50,800
We will.

363
00:23:36,940 --> 00:23:40,798
(Tomb of Du Zheng
of the Jinzhou Government Office)

364
00:23:40,799 --> 00:23:41,919
Congyi.

365
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:46,720
Your sister

366
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:49,000
acted on Dai Rong's orders

367
00:23:49,759 --> 00:23:51,200
and poisoned the Lin Residence

368
00:23:52,359 --> 00:23:54,000
in an attempt to kill me.

369
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:56,839
She failed

370
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:01,560
and instead caused
the death of her own maid.

371
00:24:03,839 --> 00:24:04,919
According to the law,

372
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:08,320
she was sentenced to exile 1,500 km away

373
00:24:09,319 --> 00:24:10,919
and banished to Qiongzhou,

374
00:24:12,759 --> 00:24:14,079
never to return.

375
00:25:07,140 --> 00:25:15,900
(Tomb of Du Zheng
of the Jinzhou Government Office)

376
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:59,520
Lin Jinqi.

377
00:26:04,599 --> 00:26:07,280
You brought my brother
and me into the Lin Residence.

378
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:10,679
We seemed to live in comfort and luxury,

379
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:12,679
without the slightest neglect.

380
00:26:14,359 --> 00:26:15,679
But in truth,

381
00:26:17,119 --> 00:26:19,320
