382
00:26:20,599 --> 00:26:23,040
as your equals.

383
00:26:26,640 --> 00:26:28,839
If you had been willing
to take me as your concubine,

384
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:32,639
I wouldn't have had
to seek Dai Rong's support,

385
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:35,800
and my brother

386
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:40,480
wouldn't be lying beneath the earth now.

387
00:27:24,319 --> 00:27:26,159
It wasn't I who looked down on you.

388
00:27:28,359 --> 00:27:31,000
You were the one
who looked down on yourself.

389
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:39,000
If you truly believed
you were our equal,

390
00:27:39,599 --> 00:27:41,358
you should have aspired

391
00:27:41,359 --> 00:27:43,839
to marry properly and become a wife,

392
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:47,200
rather than become someone's concubine.

393
00:27:59,319 --> 00:28:00,480
It's a long journey,

394
00:28:00,599 --> 00:28:01,720
so it's time to set off.

395
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:16,200
Let's go.

396
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:42,639
Go.

397
00:29:09,300 --> 00:29:10,840
