thinks very highly of this marriage.

415
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:46,560
The betrothal gifts are generous.

416
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:49,639
I think we should add
a little more to Xiuwan's dowry.

417
00:29:49,640 --> 00:29:50,800
Add more.

418
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:53,599
