429
00:30:21,799 --> 00:30:23,599
Oh, Xiuwan.

430
00:30:27,000 --> 00:30:28,119
Listen to me.

431
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:31,760
Du Zheng is already dead.

432
00:30:31,800 --> 00:30:33,670
Let's just pretend
none of this ever happened.

433
00:30:33,680 --> 00:30:35,000
Never happened.

434
00:30:35,279 --> 00:30:36,639
Hurry and forget all about them.

435
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:37,358
Forget them.

436
00:30:37,359 --> 00:30:39,040
I can't.

437
00:30:39,759 --> 00:30:40,999
Du Zheng wanted to

438
00:30:41,000 --> 00:30:43,439
