450
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:22,639
Take them off!

451
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:23,318
No!

452
00:31:23,319 --> 00:31:24,318
- Take them off!
- No!

453
00:31:24,319 --> 00:31:25,078
Take them off!

454
00:31:25,079 --> 00:31:26,199
No!

455
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:27,439
Take them off!

456
00:31:29,039 --> 00:31:29,800
You...

457
