463
00:31:50,359 --> 00:31:51,200
I...

464
00:31:55,079 --> 00:31:56,079
Xiuwan.

465
00:31:56,440 --> 00:31:57,639
These past few days,

466
00:31:57,640 --> 00:32:00,358
