471
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:10,919
Zheng saved Jinqi's life.

472
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:13,599
He was the Lin family's lifesaver.

473
00:32:14,480 --> 00:32:15,919
Bring her in.

474
00:32:21,220 --> 00:32:24,540
(Zhou Ci'er, Lin Xiuwan's wet nurse)

475
00:32:25,519 --> 00:32:26,798
Madam Zhou.

476
00:32:26,800 --> 00:32:28,616
For the sake of having
nursed and raised you,

477
00:32:28,648 --> 00:32:31,350
