478
00:32:31,359 --> 00:32:34,159
During the banquet
on the Festival of Man,

479
00:32:34,519 --> 00:32:36,960
Du Cuique bribed Madam Zhou

480
00:32:37,200 --> 00:32:38,318
and had her son Shitou

481
00:32:38,319 --> 00:32:41,040
deliberately wet Xie Zhao's clothes,

482
00:32:41,640 --> 00:32:42,598
