483
00:32:42,599 --> 00:32:45,000
to change out of the dark teal robe
he had been wearing.

484
00:32:45,240 --> 00:32:46,679
She also instructed Yinxian

485
00:32:46,720 --> 00:32:48,320
to pass information to you,

486
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:50,720
misleading you
into believing that Du Zheng

487
00:32:50,839 --> 00:32:52,439
was Xie Zhao.

488
00:32:56,440 --> 00:32:58,679
Is that true?

489
00:33:00,079 --> 00:33:02,679
Is what First Madam said true?

490
00:33:02,839 --> 00:33:04,358
I was blinded by greed.

491
00:33:04,359 --> 00:33:06,119
I was foolish in my old age.

492
00:33:06,160 --> 00:33:07,879
Please forgive me this once.

493
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:09,439
I'll never do it again.

494
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:11,079
Never again.

495
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:12,439
Madam Zhou.

496
00:33:13,119 --> 00:33:14,560
What else did you do?

497
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:16,320
When Du Cuique

498
00:33:17,759 --> 00:33:20,800
