500
00:33:23,599 --> 00:33:27,040
so Du Zheng could approach Young Lady.

501
00:33:28,039 --> 00:33:31,480
I... I also told her
where Young Lady would be

502
00:33:31,519 --> 00:33:33,040
so Du Zheng

503
00:33:33,519 --> 00:33:35,480
