511
00:34:19,320 --> 00:34:20,439
You wretch!

512
00:34:20,440 --> 00:34:21,118
You wretch!

513
00:34:21,119 --> 00:34:23,600
You treacherous wretch!

514
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:24,919
Don't hit me!

515
00:34:24,920 --> 00:34:25,919
Stop hitting me!

516
00:34:25,920 --> 00:34:26,959
I was wrong!

517
00:34:28,039 --> 00:34:30,759
I know I was wrong!

518
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:31,999
I know I was wrong!

519
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:34,279
You wretch!

520
00:34:34,280 --> 00:34:38,200
You wretch!

521
00:34:48,880 --> 00:34:51,559
My poor Xiuwan.

522
00:34:59,199 --> 00:35:04,118
May you die a wretched death!

523
00:35:04,119 --> 00:35:05,640
Mother.

524
00:35:10,760 --> 00:35:12,280
Mother.

525
00:35:17,239 --> 00:35:18,200
It's all right.

526
00:35:18,679 --> 00:35:19,640
It's all right.

527
00:35:20,199 --> 00:35:21,280
It's not your fault.

528
00:35:21,760 --> 00:35:22,919
It's not your fault.

529
00:35:24,440 --> 00:35:25,439
Let's just

530
00:35:25,720 --> 00:35:27,240
think of it as a terrible nightmare.

531
00:35:27,639 --> 00:35:28,999
Take these clothes off.

532
00:35:29,320 --> 00:35:30,518
Take them off and burn them.

533
00:35:30,519 --> 00:35:31,439
Burn them.

534
00:35:31,500 --> 00:35:33,430
We'll treat it
as nothing more than a nightmare.

535
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:34,399
Now that you're awake,

536
00:35:34,400 --> 00:35:36,160
everything can go back
to the way it was.

537
00:35:40,199 --> 00:35:41,680
My dear Xiuwan.

538
00:35:41,760 --> 00:35:44,320
You're going to marry
into the Marquis's Residence.

539
00:35:47,360 --> 00:35:49,879
I've prepared a generous dowry for you.

540
00:35:50,960 --> 00:35:52,240
Once you're married,

541
00:35:53,679 --> 00:35:55,720
you'll be the Marchioness.

542
00:35:57,559 --> 00:35:58,519
Lingxiao.

543
00:35:59,559 --> 00:36:01,399
You need to think this through.

544
00:36:01,688 --> 00:36:03,270
If we deceive the Yuan family like this,

545
00:36:03,280 --> 00:36:04,240
what if...

546
00:36:05,320 --> 00:36:06,598
Instead of joining our families,

547
00:36:06,599 --> 00:36:08,200
we could make enemies of them.

548
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:09,640
There is no what if.

549
00:36:10,559 --> 00:36:11,919
Absolutely not.

550
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:13,959
These are all trusted servants.

551
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:17,310
If you say nothing and I say nothing,
no one will ever know.

552
00:36:17,320 --> 00:36:18,640
No one will know.

553
00:36:19,920 --> 00:36:20,600
You...

554
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:21,919
Shunhua.

555
00:36:23,239 --> 00:36:25,720
This isn't like what happened
with the Xie family.

556
00:36:26,039 --> 00:36:27,519
I've already accepted the match

557
00:36:27,528 --> 00:36:29,736
and received the Yuan family's
formal marriage proposal.

558
00:36:30,039 --> 00:36:31,600
If we back out now

559
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:32,919
and word gets out,

560
00:36:33,079 --> 00:36:34,439
Xiuwan

561
00:36:34,679 --> 00:36:37,240
will never be able
to arrange another marriage.

562
00:36:38,840 --> 00:36:39,800
Shunhua.

563
00:36:40,039 --> 00:36:41,718
You and I are as close as sisters.

564
00:36:41,719 --> 00:36:44,080
Xiuwan is like your own daughter.

565
00:36:44,239 --> 00:36:46,479
Please help us.

566
00:36:46,616 --> 00:36:49,000
As long as you're willing
to help us keep this quiet,

567
00:36:49,239 --> 00:36:51,120
we can pretend none of it ever happened.

568
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:31,120
Changmin.

569
00:37:31,639 --> 00:37:32,839
Yes, Father.

570
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:36,760
Go to Marquis Yongchang's
Residence tomorrow

571
00:37:38,239 --> 00:37:40,959
and apologize to Old Madam Yuan.

572
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:43,559
Call off this marriage.

573
00:37:43,760 --> 00:37:44,640
No!

574
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,479
Absolutely not!

575
00:37:50,119 --> 00:37:51,240
Old Master.

576
00:37:51,559 --> 00:37:52,558
Everyone in Jinling City

577
00:37:52,559 --> 00:37:54,320
already knows that the Lin family

578
00:37:54,360 --> 00:37:56,760
is arranging a marriage
with Marquis Yongchang's family.

579
00:37:58,559 --> 00:38:01,240
If we apologize
and call off the marriage,

580
00:38:02,239 --> 00:38:04,879
Xiuwan's reputation will be ruined.

581
00:38:05,679 --> 00:38:08,160
How is she supposed
to face the world after that?

582
00:38:10,920 --> 00:38:13,519
Then there is only one other way.

583
00:38:15,239 --> 00:38:18,720
The Lin family's Second Young Lady
suddenly falls gravely ill

584
00:38:20,760 --> 00:38:22,999
and dies unexpectedly
at midnight tonight.

585
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:24,120
No!

586
00:38:24,159 --> 00:38:26,479
No!

587
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:28,678
No!

588
00:38:28,679 --> 00:38:30,118
- Father!
- No!

589
00:38:30,119 --> 00:38:30,959
No!

590
00:38:30,960 --> 00:38:32,959
No, Shunhua! No!

591
00:38:32,960 --> 00:38:34,080
No!

592
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:37,352
Xiuwan is young and naive.

593
00:38:37,416 --> 00:38:39,230
That's why she
fell into a villain's trap.

594
00:38:39,239 --> 00:38:41,879
Please show her mercy, Old Master!

595
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:45,600
Madam Wang has lost all sense.

596
00:38:46,039 --> 00:38:47,720
Have you lost yours, too?

597
00:38:49,239 --> 00:38:51,120
Do you think that now Du Zheng is dead,

598
00:38:51,239 --> 00:38:52,999
you can hide the truth from everyone

599
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:55,320
and pretend nothing ever happened?

600
00:38:55,920 --> 00:38:58,800
Du Cuique is still alive.

601
00:38:59,760 --> 00:39:02,720
And Marquis Yongchang
is presiding over her case.

602
00:39:03,840 --> 00:39:06,118
Do you think Du Cuique

603
00:39:06,119 --> 00:39:07,999
will help you cover up the truth?

604
00:39:17,880 --> 00:39:19,640
What's done cannot be undone.

605
00:39:20,760 --> 00:39:23,120
For the sake
of the Lin family's reputation,

606
00:39:23,639 --> 00:39:25,718
and so the other young ladies
of the Lin family

607
00:39:25,719 --> 00:39:27,600
can still make good marriages,

608
00:39:27,840 --> 00:39:28,919
you...

609
00:39:31,199 --> 00:39:32,640
must die.

610
00:39:44,519 --> 00:39:45,640
You...

611
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:50,479
want to drive my Xiuwan to her death.

612
00:39:57,440 --> 00:39:58,600
You...

613
00:40:00,559 --> 00:40:02,879
want to drive my Xiuwan to her death?

614
00:40:14,239 --> 00:40:15,399
They want to

615
00:40:16,920 --> 00:40:19,039
drive my Xiuwan to her death.

616
00:40:24,519 --> 00:40:26,640
They want to drive
my Xiuwan to her death.

617
00:40:29,360 --> 00:40:30,680
Then I...

618
00:40:34,280 --> 00:40:36,479
Then I don't want to live either!

619
00:40:37,880 --> 00:40:38,999
Mother!

620
00:40:47,039 --> 00:40:48,120
Mother!

621
00:40:51,599 --> 00:40:52,839
Mother!

622
00:40:56,880 --> 00:40:58,039
Lingxiao.

623
00:41:02,679 --> 00:41:04,359
Your children are still young.

624
00:41:04,400 --> 00:41:06,680
You mustn't do anything foolish.

625
00:41:09,000 --> 00:41:11,999
They want to drive
my Xiuwan to her death.

626
00:41:12,039 --> 00:41:15,200
How can I go on living?

627
00:41:16,920 --> 00:41:19,559
How am I supposed to live?

628
00:41:24,960 --> 00:41:25,839
Grandfather.

629
00:41:26,920 --> 00:41:28,439
Xiuwan did make a mistake,

630
00:41:28,559 --> 00:41:29,959
but it doesn't warrant death.

631
00:41:29,992 --> 00:41:31,990
I was the one
who brought trouble into our home.

632
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:33,320
That's where it all began.

633
00:41:34,639 --> 00:41:37,120
Please spare Xiuwan, Grandfather.

634
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:40,359
If I spare her,

635
00:41:40,599 --> 00:41:42,839
who will spare the Lin family?

636
00:41:44,039 --> 00:41:47,080
The Lin family is already
at odds with the Zhao family.

637
00:41:47,119 --> 00:41:47,919
Must we

638
00:41:47,920 --> 00:41:50,479
make an enemy
of the Marquis's family as well?

639
00:41:51,416 --> 00:41:52,904
The matchmaker came today

640
00:41:52,920 --> 00:41:54,712
to convey messages
between the two families

641
00:41:54,776 --> 00:41:56,740
and ask whether
the young lady's family consented.

642
00:41:56,750 --> 00:41:58,640
The birth-date cards
haven't been exchanged yet.

643
00:41:59,159 --> 00:42:01,720
The Lin and Yuan families
are only discussing a marriage.

644
00:42:03,239 --> 00:42:04,359
Our Lin family

645
00:42:04,960 --> 00:42:06,640
doesn't have only one young lady.

646
00:42:09,880 --> 00:42:11,800
You mean Xiuru?

647
00:42:56,639 --> 00:42:59,640
I'm willing to take Xiuwan's place

648
00:42:59,880 --> 00:43:01,240
and marry into the Yuan family.

649
00:43:04,740 --> 00:43:07,780
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

650
00:43:08,280 --> 00:43:10,919
Next year is
the triennial provincial examination.

651
00:43:11,119 --> 00:43:13,559
Aren't you preparing
for the provincial examination?

652
00:43:14,159 --> 00:43:15,518
Mister Lu has trouble with his hand

653
00:43:15,519 --> 00:43:16,839
and finds it difficult to write,

654
00:43:16,880 --> 00:43:19,200
so he hired me
to transcribe lyrics and songs.

655
00:43:19,679 --> 00:43:22,999
That way, I can earn some money
to help support my family.

656
00:43:23,320 --> 00:43:25,479
Now I need to prepare
for the provincial examination,

657
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:27,704
