for the examination.

662
00:43:38,679 --> 00:43:39,640
Lanxiang.

663
00:43:40,000 --> 00:43:41,200
No need to fuss.

664
00:43:41,256 --> 00:43:42,744
I just came to see how you're doing.

665
00:43:42,750 --> 00:43:44,160
I'll sit for a while and then leave.

666
